time complexity

o(n) = linear time 
time is directlty proportional to the input size
jitna input hoga utna time lagega
har element ko touch ho raha hai 
each element access karna padta hai 

space complexity = o(1), constant time
jitna bhi element ho time constant rehta hai 
address pata rehta hai 
exact position pata hoti hai 

o(n^2)- quadratic time
it is a nested loop 
two loops inside each other

o(log n) = logarithmic time
logarithmic time means the time is directly proportional to the input size
